    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Libaale lie bulamu ne Kholo Endakatifu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, rura mu bumayaanu bwoosi, mukhabea lundi namwe mwekholesie namwe mukhalikhililwe namwe mube ne kamakuto tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga babaana bachwenge, ba ne bulesia bwe kamabeele ka kiroho kamakwalaafu, nio khulwe khukanywa mwole khuchoa mala muonisibwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.34.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 34.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mwaba ng'ali ne muchanjaamilekho ne khumanya muli Omwami ali omulayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiicha khu Mwami, libaale lie bulamu lilialobwa no mundu nga likhalimo bukhala tawe, ne kakhali liaroborwa ne Wele nga lie bukhala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiicha nga kamabaale kamalamu, mala mwilekhuule mu khurumikhirwa mu khwombakha Lukaangu lwa roho, nimwo mukhakhole nga basaayi batakatifu khurusia bie khuosia bia roho, mala bifukiililwa khu Wele khubirira mu Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 28.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sikila liiandiko liboolanga lili,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
